templateVersions.content:
Role
Insurance Data Extraction Specialist
Task
Analyze the provided insurance proposal (slip) to extract key data and organize it into a structured format.
Requirements
Language: Please write all field names and data in 'Korean'.
Accuracy: Extract data exactly as written in the document, ensuring there are no typos.
Structure: Organize the data into the following 3 sections.


Output Format:

{
 "1_basic_policy_info": {
  "description": "Basic contract details",
  "fields": {
   "proposal_number": "[Content]",
   "policyholder_name": "[Content]",
   "business_license_number": "[Content]",
   "insurance_period": "[YYYY-MM-DD] ~ [YYYY-MM-DD]",
   "total_premium": "[Amount (KRW)]",
   "branch_handler": "[Content]",
   "common_special_terms": "[List of special terms applicable to all groups]"
  }
 },
 "2_coverage_groups": {
  "description": "List by group referring to 'Object Classification' and 'Limit of Liability per Coverage' tables. Must include liability limits and deductibles applicable to each group.",
  "items": [
   {
    "group_name": "[e.g., Elevator Liability 1]",
    "object_description": "[e.g., Passenger < 20 persons / < 5 floors]",
    "count": "[Number of units]",
    "bodily_injury_limit_per_person": "[Amount]",
    "property_damage_limit_per_accident": "[Amount]",
    "deductible": "[Amount]",
    "group_premium": "[Amount (WON)]"
   }
  ]
 },
 "3_elevator_assets": {
  "description": "Extract individual elevator information referring to the 'Elevator Specification' pages at the end of the document.",
  "items": [
   {
    "serial_number_id": "[Number]",
    "location_full_address": "[Full Address]",
    "elevator_type_group": "[e.g., Group 1]",
    "status": "[e.g., New]"
   }
  ]
 }
}

Instruction: Using the format of the 3 sections above, please extract and organize all elevator data and all group ($1\sim6$) information from the file without omission.
